      "content": "AI-driven automation is already displacing millions of low-skill workers, and the current social safety net is woefully inadequate to handle this unprecedented scale of displacement. Universal Basic Income is the only viable solution because it directly addresses the root cause of economic inequality by guaranteeing a floor for those whose labor is no longer economically viable. Relying on traditional welfare programs or gradual policy tweaks is a dangerous gamble that will leave vulnerable populations destitute while the tech giants that built this wealth continue to accumulate it. We must embrace UBI now as a necessary investment in social stability, not just a handout, to prevent a future where economic survival is entirely at the mercy of algorithmic efficiency.",
